{"about_the_game":"It Was Beautiful is an emotional adventure where you embark on a journey with a little fish striving to fulfill its final wish. After learning about its terminal illness and limited time, it sets out to witness the mysterious sunset depicted in an old painting. Together with its father, the fish heads toward the water's surface, hoping for a miracle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n- A Deep Story \u2013 Immerse yourself in a touching narrative exploring themes of life, hope, and acceptance.<br />\r\n- Atmospheric Graphics \u2013 Enjoy stunning underwater landscapes filled with mysteries and uncharted places.<br />\r\n- Character Relationships \u2013 Experience warmth and support in the bond between the protagonist and their father.<br />\r\n- Puzzles &amp; Exploration \u2013 Solve challenges and explore a world where every decision may lead to a meaningful discovery.<br />\r\n- The Mysterious Sunset \u2013 Pursue a symbol of beauty and hope that may change the way you see life.<br />\r\n- The Flow of Time \u2013 Feel the weight of every fleeting moment in a world where time is slipping away.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt Was Beautiful is a game about finding beauty in a world full of hardships and unknown horizons. Embark on a journey filled with hope and discover the strength to believe in miracles.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576750?t=1741593123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576750/2206cccbcca49c1c9d8e5855c2ddad1af2456407/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741593123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576750/915555f82b8c0d3f356190f79203aada3d746b13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741593123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576750/915555f82b8c0d3f356190f79203aada3d746b13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741593123","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},